notes.content:
Content of the patch:
[list]
[*] Sfx update
[*] Fixed a screen resolution bug with scrolling UI, when different from 1920x1080
[*] Minor game economy changes
[*] Fixed stain traps bug which would some time keep slowing down even after the player exits from its hitbox
[*] Fixed a bug with timers and the Time Rune
[*] Minor fix with the spawn of eyes and mouths
[*] Changed starting timer of cells
[*] Changed cell max resistance to Hand destruction
[*] Fixed a issue with upgrade of Time Rune effect
[*] Changed the frequency of Hand Attacks
[*] Fixed for good a bug with the seed, related to orb artifacts
[*] Lowered the odds of many artifacts as secret treasures in the seed
[*] Fixed an event bug which would trigger only during the very first run (now it won't happen at all anymore)
[*] Boosts to loot resources will display the actual amount when opening chests and getting quest rewards
[*] Fixed a battle bug with collisions which few times would make the player stick with an enemy
[*] Fixed the flickering which occurs in worldmap when zapping through several squares with/without the soft warning active on them
[*] Changed the level of some places in worldmap;
[*] Fixed an element property which wasn't inherited properly from particles generated from your skills;
[*] fixed a flaw in the damage boost of the Spiked Shield artifact;
[*] Block and walls destruction from your bombs, now will happen even in case a battle would start meanwhile;
[*] Fixed a sprite assignment of Coin Shower skill;
[*] Now the player will change room only if moving towards the door (can't be kicked out anymore);
[*] Traps cannot damage anymore, while in combat;
[*] The Compass will point to the next artifact properly, in case The Hand destroys the dungeon pointed from the compass;
[*] Fixed a bug about The Hand's spawn position in case of Hand Hit due to an actual Critical Warning;
[*] Lava in worldmap now will properly cause damage when the player steps on it;
[*] Changed the odds of blocked passages in dungeon, starting from Area 3;
[*] Now generic hidden passages will spawn properly in dungeon, starting from Area 3;
[*] Known weapons and artifacts will display their level in their UI also in case they have to be found again;
[/list]

Changelog:
[list]
[*] Fixed Critical hit gimmick, now it works as intended;
[*] Minor localization fix;
[*] Various artifacts fix and balancements;
[*] Fixed Status ailments gimmick, in particular with Frozen Bomb and Shadow Slug artifact;
[*] Added minimap to dungeon;
[*] Improved collision sounds cue when exploiting a weakness/resistance and/or when a critical hit is landed;
[*] Improved sounds collisions direction pan;
[*] Various minor fix and improvements;
[*] Minor enemy frame adjustments;
[*] minor fix to dungeon room explored and explore quest
[*] minor cooldown fix;
[*] minor sound adjustments;
[*] improved UX interactions with sounds;
[/list]
The update will require the refresh of the current run
